    "description": "The Mortgage Loans Closings Retrieval API provides access to information regarding completed mortgage loan closings. This endpoint allows users to retrieve detailed listings of mortgage loans that have reached the closing stage, facilitating transparency and record-keeping in the loan process. Typical consumers of this API include loan officers, financial analysts, and real estate professionals who require insights into closing transactions. By leveraging this data, stakeholders can manage reporting, compliance, and overall mortgage portfolio assessments more effectively.",
